cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Public salary ranges from 266 companies (weekly snapshot)"
abstract: >-
  Every job posting that states a pay range, collected from 266 companies' own
  public job-board APIs (Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby, Workable, Personio, Workday)
  and normalised to annual USD with live FX rates. The original currency and
  local amount are kept in every row. Regenerated weekly; each snapshot is
  published as a tagged GitHub release.
